<title>USA: Cleveland Public Power $122 mln revs repriced.</title>
<headline>Cleveland Public Power $122 mln revs repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it repriced a $122.5 million Cleveland, Ohio, Public Power System first mortgage revenue refunding bonds, Series 1996, Sub-Series 1, trimming yields, including cutting the yield in 2024 to 5.61 percent from 5.63 percent.</p>
<p>CITY OF CLEVELAND, OHIO</p>
<p>RE: $122,565,000*</p>
<p>PUBLIC POWER SYSTEM FIRST MORTGAGE</p>
<p>REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>SUB-SERIES 1</p>
<p>WE HAVE RECEIVED THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE PRICE CHANGE 2016, 2018, 2020, 2024 &amp; COUPON CHANGE IN 2009.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
